    <string name="publication_isolate_body">The previous commit and paths will remain unchanged. A new publication will use a unique path; this can create a remote duplicate if the first response was lost. Nothing is deleted remotely.</string>
    <string name="publication_close_all_body">No case in this batch was accepted. Rejections and reasons remain in history. Cached-copy cleanup remains separate; no source original will be deleted.</string>
    <string name="controls_download_title">Download %1$s?</string><string name="controls_download_body">Download from public TensorFlow storage without an HF token. Maximum allowance: 64 MB. Labels and metadata are read from the weights. Incompatible imports are blocked. Check the model terms before redistribution. The active model is not replaced.</string>
